  "title": "Adverbs of place and manner",
  "description": "Here, there, everywhere, well, quickly… and how to form adverbs from adjectives.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Where",
      "text": "Nigdzie (nowhere), nikt (nobody) and nic (nothing) need nie before the verb: Nigdzie nie byłem.",
      "table": {
        "columns": ["Polish", "English", "Example", "In English"],
        "rows": [
          ["tu, tutaj", "here", "Mieszkam tutaj.", "I live here."],
          ["tam", "there", "Tam jest dworzec.", "The station is over there."],
          ["wszędzie", "everywhere", "Wszędzie są turyści.", "There are tourists everywhere."],
          ["nigdzie", "nowhere", "Nigdzie nie byłem.", "I haven't been anywhere."],
          ["gdzieś", "somewhere", "Gdzieś tu jest kawiarnia.", "There's a café somewhere here."],
          ["blisko", "near", "Sklep jest blisko.", "The shop is near."],
          ["daleko", "far", "To daleko stąd.", "It's far from here."],
          [
            "na górze",
            "upstairs; at the top",
            "Sypialnia jest na górze.",
            "The bedroom is upstairs."
          ],
          [
            "na dole",
            "downstairs; at the bottom",
            "Kuchnia jest na dole.",
            "The kitchen is downstairs."
          ],
          ["w środku", "inside", "Poczekaj w środku.", "Wait inside."],
          ["na zewnątrz", "outside", "Jest zimno na zewnątrz.", "It's cold outside."]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "heading": "How",
      "text": "Most adverbs of manner come from adjectives: -y or -i becomes -o or -ie. Learn the ending with the word; dobry gives the irregular dobrze.",
      "table": {
        "columns": ["Adjective", "Adverb", "Meaning"],
        "rows": [
          ["szybki", "szybko", "quickly"],
          ["wolny", "wolno", "slowly"],
          ["głośny", "głośno", "loudly"],
          ["cichy", "cicho", "quietly"],
          ["łatwy", "łatwo", "easily"],
          ["ładny", "ładnie", "nicely"],
          ["dobry", "dobrze", "well"],
          ["zły", "źle", "badly"]
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
